    {
        "content": "<p>Inspired by </p>\n<p><a class=\"stream-topic\" data-stream-id=\"287929\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/Technical.20Debt.20Counters/with/585672178\">#mathlib4 &gt; Technical Debt Counters</a> </p>\n<p>Here is some technical dept metrics for Physlib. I would very much appreciate work/ideas how we can reduce these. </p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Technical Debt</th>\n<th>Count</th>\n<th>Common fix</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aleanprover-community%2Fphyslib+%22set_option+maxHeartbeats%22&amp;type=code\">maxHeartbeats modifications</a></td>\n<td>30</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aleanprover-community%2Fphyslib+%22backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency%22&amp;type=code\">backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency</a></td>\n<td>1269</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aleanprover-community%2Fphyslib+%22erw+%5B%22&amp;type=code\">erw</a></td>\n<td>473</td>\n<td>Fixing API or definitions, can use <code>erw?</code> to help.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aleanprover-community%2Fphyslib+%22unfold%22&amp;type=code\">unfold</a></td>\n<td>323</td>\n<td>Adding a lemma <code>name_eq</code> expressing the definition.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>files over 1500 lines long</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>(edit to include <code>unfold</code> - maybe not considered by everyone as technical debt, but maybe good to have an idea of how much it is used).</p>",
